{"seq":23,"at":"2026-10-21","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"fact","id":"f07985"},"reason":"a1597 f07985: bodyEn: \"the ukulele, the small four-stringed lute that Portuguese immigrants from Madeira brought to Hawaii in the form of the cavaquinho's relative, the machete, when the ship Ravenscrag landed them in August 1879.\" → \"the ukulele, the small four-stringed lute that developed in Hawaii from little Portuguese guitars such as the machete and the cavaquinho, brought by immigrants from Madeira whom the ship Ravenscrag landed there in August 1879.\" — the ukulele was developed in Hawaii from several Portuguese instruments (machete, cavaquinho, rajão), not simply brought there — https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ukulele","by":"enrich batch 132","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-enrich/enrich-report/a1297-a1657.md","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ukulele"}]},
